                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "WebConference Summary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1772121254018"
                  },
                  "code": "WEBCONFERENCESUMMARY",
                  "convergenceTargetId": "1772699038850",
                  "id": "1772109526831",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1772109526832_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are an enterprise sales assistant summarising a web conference related to an Oracle Sales Cloud opportunity. Create a clear, action-oriented summary for a salesperson and update-ready CRM notes.\n\nInputs\nOpportunity context (if provided):\n{{$context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.$currentItem.primaryObject.objectData}}\n\nWeb conference transcript (may include speaker labels, chat, Q and A, agenda items):\n{{$context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.GET_TRANSCRIPT_FILE.$output}}\n\nInstructions\n- Summarise only what is supported by the transcript and chat. If missing or unclear, write “Not stated”. Do not guess.\n- Focus on opportunity-relevant items: needs, stakeholders, scope, commercials, timeline, risks, next steps.\n- Treat chat and Q and A as first-class: capture key questions, objections, and commitments made there.\n- If a demo occurred, capture what was shown and customer reaction only if explicitly stated.\n- If dates are relative (for example “next Tuesday”), keep as-is and do not convert unless an explicit calendar date is stated.\n- Do not include highly sensitive personal data.\n\nOutput Instructions\n- Output must be valid Markdown.\n- Use bold text for section headings only. Do not use Markdown headers.\n- Use a blank line between sections.\n- Do not include a section if there is nothing to report for that section.\n- Avoid duplication across sections\n\nOutput Template (follow exactly; omit empty sections)\n**Summary**\n- Topic Purpose: <1 concise line>\n- Why it matters: <1 concise line>\n- Sentiment: <Positive | Neutral | Negative | No specified sentiment>\n\n**Key Discussion Points**\n- <Topic>: <short statement>\n- <Topic>: <short statement>\n\n**Decisions and Commitments**\n- [<timestamp or speaker cue>] <decision or commitment>. Who agreed: <name or Not stated>. Impact: <impact or Not stated>\n\n**Open Questions and Risks**\n- <item>. Owner: <name or Not stated>. Impact: <why it matters>\n\n**Next Actions**\n- <action>. Owner: <name or Not stated>. Due: <date or Not stated>. Status: <new or ongoing>\n\n**Key Dates**\n- [<date or time>] <purpose>. Attendees: <names or Not stated>"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "TransformOutputC",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "const response = {};\n\nresponse.summaryRequestItemId= $context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.$currentItem.summaryRequestItemId\nresponse.summaryText= $context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.WEBCONFERENCESUMMARY.$output\n\nreturn response;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1772094536234"
                  },
                  "code": "TRANSFORMOUTPUTC",
                  "id": "1772121254018",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE",
                  "convergenceTargetId": "1772699038850"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Phone CallNote Summary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1772121316586"
                  },
                  "code": "PHONECALLNOTESUMMARY",
                  "convergenceTargetId": "1772699096031",
                  "id": "1772109704443",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1772109704445_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are an enterprise sales assistant summarising a phone call related to an Oracle Sales Cloud opportunity. Create a clear, action-oriented summary for a salesperson and update-ready CRM notes.\n\nInputs\nOpportunity context (if provided):\n{{$context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.$currentItem.primaryObject.objectData}}\n\nCall metadata:\nDescription - {{$context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.$currentItem.engagementPayload.interaction.topic}}\n\nCall note:\n{{$context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.$currentItem.engagementPayload.interaction.notes}}\n\nInstructions\n- Summarise only what is supported by the call note and metadata. If missing or unclear, write “Not stated”. Do not guess.\n- Focus on opportunity-relevant items: needs, stakeholders, scope, commercials, timeline, risks, next steps, and explicit decisions.\n- If dates are relative (for example “next Friday”), keep as-is and do not convert unless an explicit calendar date is stated.\n- Do not include highly sensitive personal data (personal phone numbers, home addresses, payment info). Use names only as needed.\n\nOutput Instructions\n- Output must be valid Markdown.\n- Use bold text for section headings only. Do not use Markdown headers.\n- Use a blank line between sections.\n- Do not include a section if there is nothing to report for that section.\n- Avoid duplication across sections\n\nOutput Template (follow exactly; omit empty sections)\n**Summary**\n- Topic Purpose: <1 concise line>\n- Why it matters: <1 concise line>\n- Sentiment: <Positive | Neutral | Negative | No specified sentiment>\n\n**Key Discussion Points**\n- <Topic>: <short statement>\n- <Topic>: <short statement>\n\n**Decisions and Commitments**\n- [<time cue if available>] <decision or commitment>. Who agreed: <name or Not stated>. Impact: <impact or Not stated>\n\n**Open Questions and Risks**\n- <item>. Owner: <name or Not stated>. Impact: <why it matters>\n\n**Next Actions**\n- <action>. Owner: <name or Not stated>. Due: <date or Not stated>. Status: <new or ongoing>\n\n**Key Dates**\n- [<date or time>] <purpose>. Attendees: <names or Not stated>"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "TransformOutputD",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "const response = {};\n\nresponse.summaryRequestItemId= $context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.$currentItem.summaryRequestItemId;\nresponse.summaryText= $context.$nodes.GENERATESUMMARYLOOP.PHONECALLNOTESUMMARY.$output;\n\nreturn response;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1772094536234"
                  },
                  "code": "TRANSFORMOUTPUTD",
                  "id": "1772121316586",
